</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bf21afce-7f01-11f1-af6d-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-13T163612Z-1269730039-RC24DMAN3E13-RTRMADP-3-UKRAINE-CRISIS-COALITION-FRANCE.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bf21afce-7f01-11f1-af6d-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-13T163612Z-1269730039-RC24DMAN3E13-RTRMADP-3-UKRAINE-CRISIS-COALITION-FRANCE.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">3fd490d0-7f5e-11f1-b426-45e43ba2eff1</guid><pubDate>Tue, 14 Jul 2026 09:40:49 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bf21afce-7f01-11f1-af6d-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-13T163612Z-1269730039-RC24DMAN3E13-RTRMADP-3-UKRAINE-CRISIS-COALITION-FRANCE.jpg">via REUTERS - Teresa Suarez</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>France, Germany, UK condemn Iran attacks as renewed fighting with US puts peace deal at risk</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260713-france-germany-uk-condemn-iran-attacks-as-renewed-fighting-with-us-puts-peace-deal-at-risk</link><description>
